Strategy ai tasks that can be delegated
title end

paragraph start
An AI may draft options for the goal, position and roadmap pages, run competitor audits from public pages, summarise findings and check pages against the templates.
paragraph end

paragraph start
An AI does not decide the mission, the goals, the position or the gates. The owner decides and the AI records.
paragraph end

